        {
          "text": "Can you use canned pineapple?",
          "url": null,
          "urls": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Yes, but not the kind in syrup! Just drain it really well before using. The sweetness in pineapple fried rice comes from the pineapple itself, so give it a quick taste—if it’s not quite sweet enough, you can always add a bit of sugar at the end to bring it all together.",
          "url": null,
          "urls": null
        },
        {
          "text": "can you share the recipe of yellow curry powder used in this recipe.",
          "url": null,
          "urls": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Hey Naxza, the recipe uses store-bought yellow curry powder. Any brand is fine.",
          "url": null,
          "urls": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Wife and I enjoyed this very much. I never have success with Jasmine rice so used Basmati other than that, followed the recipe I used carrots onion and garden peas. Salad onions as a garnish.",
