        "h_title": "Chicken Pineapple Fried Rice Recipe (Khao Pad Sapparod)",
        "main_title": "Chicken Pineapple Fried Rice Recipe (Khao Pad Sapparod)",
        "author": "Praew",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "This Thai chicken pineapple fried rice recipe is easy, healthy, and ready in under 30 minutes in one pan. It’s the perfect quick weeknight dinner with crisp vegetables and a flavorful stir-fry sauce.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Pineapple chicken fried rice is a Thai stir-fry made with rice, chicken, vegetables, and pineapple. The sweet pineapple balances the savory stir-fry sauce and adds a juicy, tropical flavor to the dish.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
