      {
        "h_title": "Khao pad sapparod",
        "main_title": "Chicken Pineapple Fried Rice Recipe (Khao Pad Sapparod)",
        "author": "Praew",
        "language": "en",
        "level": 2,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "I first had khao pad sapparod with my husband at a Thai restaurant, and it arrived served inside a pineapple. It looked like a tropical dream, and tasted even better!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The rice was subtly sweet, the pineapple juicy, the veggies crisp, and the chicken perfectly tender.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "It was the perfect summer meal. Since then, I’ve made this dish more times than I can count. This version is the one we always come back to, and I’m sure you’ll love it just as much!",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Learn Thai cooking step by step",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "My cookbook is a combination of authentic Thai recipes and Western dishes cooked with Thai flavors and ingredients. It’s a great starting point if you’re new to Thai cooking or want to cook it more often.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      },
